  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A rocket scientist named Timothy Taylor once told the religious studies scholar Diana Pasulka that the next big advance in his field would come from hers. Michels relays the exchange from Pasulka's book American Cosmic: when she asked Taylor why he was interested in her work on religion, he answered, \"The next development in my field, rocket science, will come from yours, religion.\" Michels tells it because it would mean someone inside the space world saw belief and religious experience as a path to new technology."
